= Walkthrough =

== Castle Route and Door Keys ==
This quest takes place during [[The Tragic Tale of House Everling]]. See that quest's [[The Tragic Tale of House Everling#Castle Access and Library Key|library-key guide]] for the four harpsichord ground items and combine station.

# Find [[Lady Sileniu Everling]] in the northeast of the second floor, at (552, -132, 17). Hail her, ask about '''"He"''', then '''"swear"'''.
# Return downstairs to [[Plimptos]] at (102, -151, 7). Hail him, say '''"crimes"''', then '''"brought back"''' to receive the sword hilt.
# Speak to [[Alexa`s Handmaiden|Alexa's Handmaiden]] in the southeast area of the second floor, at (172, -178, 17).
# Kill all the sisters around the edges of the second-floor map. Their linked pages and recorded locations are listed below.
# Return to [[Alexa`s Handmaiden|Alexa's Handmaiden]] to receive the [[Nektropos Great Room Key]].
# Kill [[Alexa Everling]] in the southwest great room, just off the main hall on the second floor, to obtain the [[Nektropos Private Chamber Key]]. Her exact coordinates have not yet been recorded.
# Go to the northwest area of the second floor. In [[Guard Captain Ga`Vin|the Guard Captain's room]] on the west side, use the secret entrance behind the bookshelf to descend into the basement. The captain's exact coordinates have not yet been recorded.
# Follow the basement corridor southwest and kill [[The Juggernaught|the Juggernaut]] at (-331, 310, -112) to obtain the [[Nektropos Basement Key]].
# Enter the room beside the Juggernaut and defeat [[Lord Rikantus Everling]] at (-382, 181, -112), using the combat guidance below.
# Return to [[Plimptos]] and say '''"end"'''. He disappears. Then return to [[The Tragic Tale of House Everling#Quest Dialogue and Completion|the House Everling quest]]: tell Lady Everling '''"dead"''' and '''"Confess"''', kill her, then return to Lord Ollix and say '''"tragic"'''.

